        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-10T03:25:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>From WalkingTarget’s notes on the Dark Watch Interlude</p><p>\n&gt; </p><p><span>Expatriette has a motorcycle, Setback does the standard rooftop-leaping style of patrol (and doesn't fall off too often), Nightmist has portal magic (and is pretty good at doing the short-distance thing) and Harpy learns this too eventually, Mr. Fixer might have to lean on the magic-users a bit more heavily than the others.</span></p><p><span>\n</span></p>",
